# A GitHub classic Personal Access Token with NO scopes.
# Public contribution calendars need no scopes at all — the token is only
# required because the GraphQL v4 API rejects unauthenticated requests.
#
# Comma-separate several tokens to raise the effective rate limit; the client
# round-robins between them (5,000 requests/hour each).
TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional. Comma-separated list of usernames this instance will render.
# Leave unset to serve any username. Set it once the URL is public to stop
# other people burning your token quota.
# WHITELIST=olivierluethy,someoneelse
